# Normalise line endings in the repo.
#
# This repo is worked on from WSL (LF) and Windows (CRLF) at the same time. With
# no policy, a Windows checkout rewrites every line of every file and each commit
# from that side arrives as a 98-file, 17000-line diff that buries the actual
# change. Measured 2026-08-07 on a report commit that touched 6 files.
#
# text=auto: store LF in git, check out native. Nothing changes for readers;
# it stops the churn at commit time.
* text=auto

# Binary / generated — never touch these.
*.sqlite  binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.pdf     binary
*.xml     text eol=lf
*.excalidraw text eol=lf
